+                 ring_rows: int | None = None) -> Geometry:
+    """GLM's engine; ``mtp``: whether it holds the MTP head's caches and buffers (None: when the checkpoint has one);
+    ``kv``: the DSA caches' format (TF_GLM_KV, MiaAI-Lab's 0038): bf16 as before, or fp8, the latent rows and the
+    indexer's pooled keys as kv8 rows and the indexer's per-token keys and gates in a ring of ``mla_index_ring`` rows
+    for windows of ``ring_rows`` (default: a prompt chunk's) instead of over the capacity."""
